# Fieldkit hire bar

Read and obey `/AGENTS.md` in this repo before writing code.

This is a **product**, not a starter tutorial or a ServiceTitan clone.

**Required (do not defer):** RLS + isolation tests, job lock, scoring, auto-assign
policy, exception queue, `pct_auto_assigned` in dbt, domain events to
Redpanda/Kafka, Dagster incremental load, SLA metrics as code, Terraform on Azure,
AI clerk only (draft job + get_metric). The LLM never assigns a technician.
No `run_sql`.

**Teach first**, then the smallest slice. Do not dump a finished app.
Do not say “we will add dbt/RLS/events later.” Those are the product.

If a change would make the resume sentence in AGENTS.md false, do not ship it.
